  "description": "Durable outbound-webhook delivery for multi-tenant ASP.NET Core SaaS. A per-endpoint transactional outbox: each (event x subscribed endpoint) is delivered and retried independently on its own back-off, so one failing endpoint never re-delivers to healthy ones. HMAC-signed POSTs with configurable headers, scale-out-safe xmin lease processor, dead-lettering, and per-attempt delivery history. The consumer plugs in an endpoint resolver + their DbContext; delivery moves off the request path in ~5 lines of Program.cs.",
